    "chunk_text": "Hikkaduwa\u2013Maradana train delayed after repeated technical issues\n\nColombo, August 12 (Daily Mirror) - Passengers travelling on the Hikkaduwa\u2013Maradana railway line faced delays today after a train developed technical problems at two stations along the route.\n\nThe train encountered technical difficulties while stopping at Beruwala and Maggona railway stations, disrupting its scheduled journey towards Maradana.\n\nRailway authorities said the technical fault had affected the Hikkaduwa\u2013Maradana service, resulting in delays to passengers using the coastal railway line."
