    "chunk_text": "Yoshitha Rajapaksa leaves CID\n\nColombo, Aug 12 (Daily Mirror) - Former President Mahinda Rajapaksa's son Yoshitha Rajapaksa left the Criminal Investigation Department (CID) a short while ago after recording a statement.\n\nRajapaksa had appeared before the CID this morning in connection with an ongoing investigation."
