    "chunk_text": "Since opening its doors, Am\u00e3na Bank has steadily expanded its presence across the country, serving a growing customer base through its 80+ branch and self-banking centre network while remaining focused on Retail, SME, and development-oriented banking with a selective approach to corporates. The Bank\u2019s asset-backed banking model continues to channel financing towards productive sectors of the economy, supporting entrepreneurs, households, and businesses in a manner aligned with its values and customer-centric promise.\n\nSpeaking at the stamp launch Amana Bank\u2019s Chairman Asgi Akbarally stated, \u201cAs we celebrate the 15th anniversary of Am\u00e3na Bank, this commemorative First Day Cover and stamp stand as a lasting tribute to a remarkable journey built on vision, resilience, and trust. It symbolizes not only the milestones we have achieved, but also the enduring confidence placed in us by our customers, shareholders, regulators, colleagues, and the communities we are privileged to serve.\n\nMore than a commemoration of the past, it reflects the values and purpose that continue to guide us forward. It tells the story of an institution founded on a bold vision, nurtured by the dedication of its people, and strengthened by the loyalty of its stakeholders. As we mark this significant occasion, we reaffirm our commitment to creating sustainable value, supporting businesses and individuals, and contributing meaningfully to the economic and social progress of our nation.\u201d\n\nAlso sharing his views Amana Bank Managing Director/CEO Mohamed Azmeer said, \u201cWe are truly honoured to have been given the opportunity to celebrate our 15th anniversary with this special commemorative cover and stamp launch."
