    "md5": "ef3900339cff5fdfc263b0c0d591e2dd",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1343,
    "chunk_text": "LOLC Finance becomes country\u2019s first financial institution to achieve \u2018WaterConscious\u2019 certification\n\nFrom left: LOLC Finance Maintenance Officer-Dinuka Rodrigo; LOLC Finance Sustainability Manager-Hasini Siriwardana; LOLC Finance COO-Montini Warnakula; SFG Managing Director-Dr. Ranjiva Munasinghe; SFG Senior Associate Sustainability Assurance and Advisory Services - Abirami Ratnakumar\n\nLOLC Finance PLC has become the first financial institution in Sri Lanka to have its Head Office operations certified as WaterConscious, marking a significant milestone in the company\u2019s sustainability journey and further reinforcing its commitment to responsible water stewardship.\n\nThe WaterConscious Certification recognises organisations that adopt a structured and systematic approach to responsible water resource management. For LOLC Finance, sustainable water management is essential to reducing operational risks, improving resource efficiency, strengthening business resilience and contributing to long-term environmental sustainability. The certification marks another important milestone in LOLC Finance\u2019s journey towards achieving water neutrality by 2040, reflecting the company\u2019s commitment to integrating environmental responsibility into its business operations and broader Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) agenda."
  },
