    "md5": "3853ead5f8963a31e15ba9929918117b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1889,
    "chunk_text": "Fly A World Consultants recognised for excellence in travel consultancy\n\nFly A World Consultants and Tourism (Pvt) Ltd has been honoured with the Excellence in Travel Consultancy Services Award in the Small Scale Services Sector at the Honor of Business Talent 2026, recognising the company\u2019s outstanding contribution to Sri Lanka\u2019s travel and tourism industry.\n\nThe award celebrates organisations that demonstrate excellence in customer service, business performance, and professional standards. It highlights Fly A World\u2019s commitment to providing reliable, personalised, and high-quality travel solutions for both leisure and business travellers.\n\nFounded by M. C. M. Shahood, Founder and Director, Fly A World Consultants and Tourism has established itself as a trusted name in the travel industry.\n\nThe company is a Civil Aviation Authority of Sri Lanka licensed travel agency, a registered member of the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority (SLTDA), and a member of the Travel Agents Association of Sri Lanka (TAASL).\n\nFly A World offers a comprehensive range of travel services, including international air ticketing, visa consultation, inbound and outbound tour operations, hotel reservations, travel insurance, and customised holiday packages.\n\nThe company also specialises in creating tailor-made travel experiences for individuals, families, corporate clients, and student travellers, providing complete support from travel planning and documentation to destination management.Over the years, the company has built a strong reputation through its customer-focused approach, professional expertise, and dedication to delivering seamless travel experiences. By continuously enhancing its service capabilities and strengthening industry partnerships, Fly A World has become a trusted travel partner for clients seeking efficient, reliable, and hassle-free travel solutions."
