    "md5": "02bdc12e53f7f89e58ad9ea22a041fae",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1601,
    "chunk_text": "Theekshana Jayarathna appointed CEO of TWCDM\n\nTWC Founder and Executive Chairman, Thilan Wijesinghe, announced the appointment of Theekshana Jayarathna as Chief Executive Officer of TWC Development Management (Pvt) Ltd (TWCDM).\n\nTWC Development Management specializes in leading complex real estate developments from concept to completion, transforming land and existing properties into economically viable and sustainable assets.\n\nThe company provides integrated development management services encompassing development strategy, project feasibility, financial and investment structuring, regulatory approvals, design management, construction oversight, marketing, operational readiness, and asset stabilization.\n\nCommenting on the recent appointment, Founder/ Executive Chairman, TWC Holdings Pvt Ltd - Thilan Wijesinghe stated, \u201cThe appointment of Theekshana reflects the continued growth and evolution of TWC\u2019s development management business. His technical and financial expertise on multiple real estate asset classes has strengthened our ability to deliver value to our clients that include local corporates, family offices and offshore investment funds.\u201d\u00a0 Prior to joining TWC in 2022, Theekshana Jayarathna spent 14 years at John Keells Group as Assistant Vice President and Head of Asset Management & New Business Development, where he gained extensive experience across the full spectrum of development management disciplines. At JKH he was involved in multiple apartment, hotel and retail projects including Cinnamon Life, having an aggregate value of approximately US$ 1.5 billion."
  },
