    "chunk_text": "Commenting on the recent appointment, Founder/ Executive Chairman, TWC Holdings Pvt Ltd - Thilan Wijesinghe stated, \u201cThe appointment of Theekshana reflects the continued growth and evolution of TWC\u2019s development management business. His technical and financial expertise on multiple real estate asset classes has strengthened our ability to deliver value to our clients that include local corporates, family offices and offshore investment funds.\u201d\u00a0 Prior to joining TWC in 2022, Theekshana Jayarathna spent 14 years at John Keells Group as Assistant Vice President and Head of Asset Management & New Business Development, where he gained extensive experience across the full spectrum of development management disciplines. At JKH he was involved in multiple apartment, hotel and retail projects including Cinnamon Life, having an aggregate value of approximately US$ 1.5 billion.\n\nTheekshana is a member of the Chartered Institute of Management Accountants (UK) and also holds qualifications in Quantity Surveying and Building Economics from the University of Reading (UK)."
